        <mxCell id="6wiaA6puWI5cDe3y5h9X-44" edge="1" parent="1" source="6wiaA6puWI5cDe3y5h9X-40" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="6wiaA6puWI5cDe3y5h9X-43">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="6wiaA6puWI5cDe3y5h9X-40" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="end" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="1081" y="1040" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="6wiaA6puWI5cDe3y5h9X-43" parent="1" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;sourseDisplacement&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;upload&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="50" width="124" x="1079" y="1150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="VqkJ6D8PxmnF8iVDtasi-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="&amp;nbsp;브러시는 어떻게 구현이 되는가.&lt;div&gt;필요한 텍스처: 원본 Tex, alpha Tex&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;P1부터 P2까지 선을 그으면,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;해당 선과 픽셀이 일정거리 이상이면&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;alphaTex를 해당 alpha로 찰힌다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;이때 선에 애매하게 걸쳐있는건 alpha를 보간해서 칠하고&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;이미 칠해진 alpha가 있다면 그중에 가장 큰 값을 칠한다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;그리고 렌더링은 alphaTex를 기반으로 원본 Tex에 해당 색을 칠한다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;위 두개의 과정은&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;scissorTest를 통해&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;dirtyRect내부에서만 작동되게 한다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;칠하는건 offscreenTex에 렌더링하고,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;그 offscreen을 canvas화면에 위치에 맞게 렌더링 한다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
